      "name": "LI.FI API \u2014 Full Suite",
      "description": "Combined test suite for LI.FI REST API.\nCovers: /tokens, /quote (all order types, slippage, Composer).\nMirrors Playwright test coverage \u2014 both layers validate the same surface.\n\nRun with Newman:\n  newman run lifi_full_suite.postman_collection.json \\\n    -e production.postman_environment.json \\\n    --reporters cli,json \\\n    --reporter-json-export newman-report.json",
      "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
    },
